<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="08">
<name>Heater &amp; Air Conditioner/Ventilation</name>
<section id="1002K_S000B" variety="S000B">
<name>Air Conditioner</name>
<ttl id="1002K_S000B_7421V_T0025" variety="T0025">
<name>Heater &amp; Air Conditioner System</name>
<para id="RM0000005KS01AX" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="5222Z-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM0000005KS01AX_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___00000W600000">
<content5 releasenbr="10">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis and Symptom Check (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005KT01BX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Basic Inspection</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the battery voltage.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Referring to the parts location and wiring diagrams, inspect areas that can be checked visually, such as blown fuses, open circuits or short circuits in the wire harness and poor connector connections in the system.</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] Communication Function</testtitle>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select [Diagnosis] → [Body] → [J/B Integration ECU] to display the [DTC/Freeze Frame Data] screen, and check the diagnostic trouble codes.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Body Multiplex Communication Section [LIN] (<xref label="Seep02" href="RM00000068J00MX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>CAN Communication System Check</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), display the [CAN Bus Diagnosis/CAN Bus Connected ECU Check] screen and check all ECUs and sensors connected to CAN communication. (see <xref label="Seep03" href="RM000001R4W009X"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No Abnormality</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Abnormal</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to CAN Communication System Section (<xref label="Seep04" href="RM0000005S001MX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTCs Using TaSCAN or Sensor Check Codes Using Panel Diagnosis</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check DTC or Sensor Check Code (see <xref label="Seep05" href="RM0000005LI015X"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Record the diagnostic trouble codes or sensor check codes.</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear DTC or Sensor Check Code</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Recheck DTC or Sensor Check Code</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded diagnostic trouble codes or sensor check codes, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the diagnostic trouble codes are output again.</ptxt>
<atten4>
<list1 type="nonmark">
<item>
<ptxt>When DTCs or sensor check codes are output, refer to "Diagnostic Trouble Code Chart" (<xref label="Seep06" href="RM0000005KU01AX"/>).</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom can be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Code output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>No code, symptom cannot be confirmed and reproduced</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 9</action-ci-right>
<result>C</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to Symptom Simulation (<xref label="Seep07" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>)</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Problem Symptoms Table (see <xref label="Seep08" href="RM0000005KX01HX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="2" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.06in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 9</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test (see <xref label="Seep09" href="RM0000005LK01FX"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor (TaSCAN)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Active Test (TaSCAN)</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Diagnosis System (see <xref label="Seep10" href="RM0000005L401DX"/>)</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspection Using Panel Diagnosis (Indicator Check)</ptxt>
</test2>
<test2>
<ptxt>Inspection Using Panel Diagnosis (Actuator Check)</ptxt>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep11" href="RM0000005KW01EX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Adjust, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Confirmation Test</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>